     <td>\f$ 2 ( \lfloor \log_2 n \rfloor + 1 ) \f$ at most</td>
     <td>section 1.2</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>lowerBound()</tt>, <tt>upperBound()</tt></td>
     <td>\f$ \lceil \log_2 ( n + 1 ) \rceil \f$, as (1)</td>
     <td>exercise 12.13</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>gallopSearch()</tt>, <tt>exponentialSearch()</tt></td>
