     space</td><td>\f$ O( 1 ) \f$</td><td>Bender and Farach-Colton
     (2000)</td></tr>
 <tr><td><tt>PlusMinusOneRangeMinimum</tt></td><td>\f$ O( n ) \f$</td>
     <td>\f$ O( 1 ) \f$, on steps of \f$ \pm 1 \f$</td>
     <td>Bender and Farach-Colton (2000)</td></tr>
